{
  "_note": "今日进度(21,158×60,card-design-system §8.1):今天达标几件 / 共几件 + 右侧进度条;右上 = 日期锚(同 22 档 progress)。\n手写产物;取数复用 flow/progress.df,零新增键(填充终点在 RCN 里 op:set 算)。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#F9FCFB\\,#EEF7F3)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#161B1D\\,#182221)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "10pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#2E9E6B|#45C793",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "19pt",
        "y": "9pt",
        "w": "92pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "11pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "113pt",
        "y": "10.5pt",
        "w": "35pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),${@i18n.masked},findNotEmpty::(${dateLbl},--))]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "alignmentH": "2"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),0,if::(eq::(${hasAny},1),1,0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "num",
            "type": "richText",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "27pt",
            "w": "78pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "spans": [
              {
                "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${done},0)]",
                "fontSize": "16.5pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
              },
              {
                "text": "/$[findNotEmpty::(${total},--)]",
                "fontSize": "10pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "numM",
            "type": "richText",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "30pt",
            "w": "78pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "spans": [
              {
                "text": "••",
                "fontSize": "16.5pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
              },
              {
                "text": "/••",
                "fontSize": "10pt",
                "typeface": "System-Bold",
                "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "还没有事项:值位「--」,进度条只画空轨(§5 结构先行)。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),0,if::(eq::(${hasAny},1),0,1))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "numE",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "10pt",
            "y": "31.95pt",
            "w": "78pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "--",
            "fontSize": "16.5pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "_note": "除数兜底:if:: 两支都会求值,total=0 直接进分母结果不可预期。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_den",
          "value": "$[if::(ge::(${total},1),${total},1)]"
        }
      },
      {
        "_note": "填充终点(轨内 pt):轨盒 58×6、线宽 6、圆头 → 可用 [3,55]。外层 round 是为 Android calc 恒返 double。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "set",
        "props": {
          "key": "_px",
          "value": "$[round::(calc::(3+52*${done}/${_den}),1)]"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "trk",
        "type": "line",
        "points": "[3,3,55,3]",
        "x": "90pt",
        "y": "30pt",
        "w": "58pt",
        "h": "6pt",
        "lineWidth": "6pt",
        "lineCap": "round",
        "strokeColor": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),#DCDDE0|#33353B,#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
        "_note": "进度轨。打码时整条换成打码灰且不画填充 —— 比例本身就是那两个数。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "0 件达标时不画填充:零长的圆头线会画成一颗点,读起来像「做了一点」。",
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),0,if::(eq::(${hasAny},1),if::(ge::(${done},1),1,0),0))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "fil",
            "type": "line",
            "points": "[3,3,$[findNotEmpty::(${_px},3)],3]",
            "x": "90pt",
            "y": "30pt",
            "w": "58pt",
            "h": "6pt",
            "lineWidth": "6pt",
            "lineCap": "round",
            "strokeColor": "#2E9E6B|#45C793"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "今日进度",
        "masked": "已隐藏"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Today",
        "masked": "Hidden"
      }
    }
  }
}
